       "workload": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next qwen4exp IQ3_S serve file MoE experts (IQ4_NL down, IQ2_S / IQ3_XXS / IQ3_S / IQ4_XS gate-up), 512 experts top-10, AMD Radeon 890M (RDNA3.5), MTP verify width 4.",
